                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "I ended up creating a simple version of the picker myself, since I didn't bother by the other features of the plugin (leaving it here for reference if someone wants same thing: https://github.com/datsfilipe/datsnvim/pull/23/files).\r\n\r\nAnyway, thanks for your work on mini plugins, they are amazing! never coming back to telescope or fzf-lua.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I ended up creating a simple version of the picker myself, since I didn't bother by the other features of the plugin (leaving it here for reference if someone wants same thing: <a href=\"https://github.com/datsfilipe/datsnvim/pull/23/files\">https://github.com/datsfilipe/datsnvim/pull/23/files</a>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Anyway, thanks for your work on mini plugins, they are amazing! never coming back to telescope or fzf-lua.</p>",
